==English==

===Interjection===
{{en-interj|head=[[fuck]] [[me]]!}}

# {{rfd-sense}} {{vulgar|literally}} Used [[imperative]]ly when sb wants a partner to [[have sex]] with theirself, often in a [[rough]] manner.
# {{rfd-redundant}} {{vulgar|slang}} An expression of [[dismay]] at undesired events happening to oneself.
#: ''Oh, '''fuck me!''' I forgot to pay that parking ticket; now they want me to appear in court!''
# {{vulgar|slang}} expression of [[surprise]], [[contempt]], [[outrage]], [[disgust]], [[boredom]], [[frustration]].

